      "proof_review": {
        "reviewed": true,
        "context_checked": true,
        "method": "Published author proof/core and local context fidelity screening",
        "note": "Read exact universal defining relations1.2/1.3, cyclic automorphism construction3.1, full Diamond-Lemma ordered basis4.1 including unique CBA overlap resolution, complete degree filtration5.4, explicit Casimir centrality6.1/6.2, Casimir leading term and basis replacement7.1/7.2/7.4/7.5, and every step of center classification8.1/8.2 through physical13. Leading commutators force equal exponents only because q is not a root of unity; subtraction of Casimir monomials lowers the filtration degree and finishes the minimal-degree contradiction. Prior Bergman Diamond Lemma is background; its full local hypotheses and ambiguity check are authored. No basis/Casimir/helper/corollary or modular-faithfulness extra count. Original selected statement/core pages rendered and visually inspected; exact header and native ZIP members verified. Editorial scope and warnings are retained."
      },
      "extra_source_paths": [
